Dense against structured matrix discharge, 2026-09-15, quiet machine, one process at a time.

"dense" is the build at commit a2529e0, in a worktree, verifying through Flock's
lincheck::verify_with_grinding; "structured" is the same tree with verify_lincheck_structured
and Program::comb_partial. Nothing else differs, and nothing on the proving side differs.

