3. The two builds accept each other's proofs, and produce the same bytes

$ ../flock-lifter-baseline/target/release/verify-only prove 219 lift-219-dense.bin
$ ./target/release/verify-only check 219 lift-219-dense.bin
result: responses=219 chunks=2 verify_s=0.055 gate=pass
$ cmp lift-219.bin lift-219-dense.bin
the two provers produced identical proofs

